Package: vpn-gate
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, iproute2, nftables, sudo
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Maintainer: ViKuzmin <96813456+ViKuzmin@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ViKuzmin/vpn-gate
Description: VPN launch gate + optional network-namespace kill switch
 VPN Gate wraps any Linux application so it refuses to start unless a
 configured VPN network interface is up. Optionally runs the app inside
 an isolated network namespace (vpn-ns-run) so traffic can only leave via
 the VPN — a real kill switch for clients like Amnezia on Debian.
 .
 Includes:
  - vpn-gate-install: bash CLI to install/remove the gate for an app
  - vpn-gate-ui: GTK4/libadwaita GUI
  - vpn-ns-run: network-namespace kill switch helper (needs root/sudo)
